# Normalise line endings for text, and never touch binaries.
#
# This repository is worked on from Windows, where git converts LF to CRLF on
# checkout. Git detects binary content on its own, but product photography is
# the most valuable asset here and a mangled image is not obvious until a
# customer sees it — so the image and font types are marked explicitly.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.webp  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
